							"paragraphStyle" : {
								"__type" : "textStyle"
							},
							"string" : "### Why?\nThere are three reasons for setting up the environment at this early stage.\n1. to provide new, useful, and configurable, FileReference origins, like `#code` and `#project`. (add as many as you need).\n2. To ensure that all the parameters for the configuration phase search path, prior to reading the configuration into the  environment  `currentVault`:  {{gtMethod:TTDictionaryConfigEnv class>>traceCurrentSearchPath|show=button}}  \n3. To ready the values of  {{gtMethod:Hub class>>namespacedSearchPath}}  used by Tactical-Tools opt-in Namespaced Classes system (experimental).   {{gtMethod:Hub class>>namespacedSearchPath}}  "
						},
