				"paragraphStyle" : {
					"__type" : "textStyle"
				},
				"string" : "# Early\nTactical-Tools do not require explicit registration in the [[StartUp/ShutDown Process]]  a simplified pragma based facility is provided. \n\nOne of the users of this facility {{gtMethod:TTFixUpOSEnvironment class>>startUpAtSystemPriority:}} implements a {{gtPragma:ttOSEnvironment}}   lookup for methods that wish to adjust the environment early in the startup process.\n\n• {{gtClass:TTFixUpOSEnvironment}} is extensible, or you can make a copy of this class for your own project that will also self-register for invocation at startUp.\n\nThe optional package {{gtPackage:Tactical-Project}} demonstrates this (note the method extensions)."
			},
			{
				"__type" : "textSnippet",
				"children" : {
					"__type" : "snippets",
					"items" : [ ]
				},
				"createEmail" : {
					"__type" : "email",
					"emailString" : "<unknown>"
				},
				"createTime" : {
