					"uidString" : "tDqgWaXPRvSTgyWZ7rlQdw=="
				},
				"paragraphStyle" : {
					"__type" : "textStyle"
				},
				"string" : "### Persistent File Stores\nGo developers frequently embed file resources into their compiled binaries. Subclass {{gtClass:ImageStore}} to add a MemoryStore that is persisted along with the image for each of your projects. The new class nominates the origin name, using an annotation{{gtPragma:origin}}."
			},
