				},
				"paragraphStyle" : {
					"__type" : "textStyle"
				},
				"string" : "### Configuration\nThe centrepiece that handles configuration is {{gtClass:TTVault}}. There is a `Hub currentVault` for the environment, but instances of vault are useful to represent other items. Any vault may have persistently backed data sources for example:\n{{gtClass:TTDictionaryConfigEnv}} reads users own config `glamorous.env` files for the current environment. Subclass this to add your own projects to this process.\n\n\n"
			}
